## Now

I’m continuously exploring emerging technologies, including AI, local LLMs, cloud databases, 
and Red Hat OpenShift, turning ideas into practical applications while building skills in 
cloud-native solutions and intelligent systems.

When I’m not researching, experimenting, or building, I’m usually learning something new, 
refining my tools, or sharing insights and lessons along the way.

